Define Sum(values) {
  Create index as Number
  Create total as Number

  Set index to 0
  Set total to 0

  While index < Length(values) {
    Set total to total + Get(values, index)
    Set index to index + 1
  }

  Return total
}

Create numbers as List
Set numbers to [5, 10, 15, 20]

Create answer as Number
Set answer to Sum(numbers)

Call Print(answer)